---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import AreaCalc from '../components/AreaCalc.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Book a Stone Sealing Quote | Spickle"
  description="Book a stone cleaning and sealing quote. Send photos and the rough size of the area, and we'll come back with a price. From $15/m²."
>
  <section class="band hairline-top">
    <div class="wrap grid">
      <div>
        <h1>Book a quote</h1>
        <p class="lede">Send a few photos and the rough size of the area, and we'll come back with a price.</p>
        <h2 class="sub">What helps us price it fast</h2>
        <ul class="list">
          <li>A few photos of the area, including any stains</li>
          <li>The approximate size in square metres, even a rough guess</li>
          <li>The stone, if you know it</li>
          <li>Your suburb</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="contacts">
          <a class="tlink" href="tel:1300220045">Call 1300 22 00 45</a>
          <a class="tlink" href="mailto:info@spickle.com.au">info@spickle.com.au</a>
        </div>
        <p class="texty">Easiest of all: text the photos. <span class="todo-inline">[Mobile number that accepts MMS/WhatsApp photos, to confirm with Lukey]</span></p>
        <p class="small">Pricing starts from $15 per m², depending on the sealer and the job. Rural jobs carry a separate travel fee, quoted up front.</p>
        <p class="small">Once we've sealed for you, the job goes in our reseal diary: we'll get in touch when yours is coming due, so you never have to track it.</p>
        <AreaCalc />
      </div>
      <div class="todo embed">ServiceM8 booking form<br />[Embed from ServiceM8 goes here: name, phone, email, address, approximate m², paving type, photos. Waiting on the embed code from Lukey.]</div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(400px, 100%), 1fr)); gap: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 6rem); align-items: start; }
  .lede { font-size: var(--step-1); color: #d6e8ee; }
  .sub { font-size: var(--step-1); margin-top: 1.5em; }
  .list { margin: 0 0 1.5em; padding: 0; list-style: none; max-width: var(--measure); }
  .list li { padding: 0.65rem 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline); color: var(--muted); }
  .list li:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hairline); }
  .contacts { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.9rem 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .texty { font-weight: 600; color: var(--white); }
  .small { font-size: var(--step--1); }
  .embed { min-height: 420px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; line-height: 1.7; }
</style>
